<title>SWEDEN: ATHLETICS-GEBRESELASSIE BREAKS INDOOR WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-GEBRESELASSIE BREAKS INDOOR WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Haile Gebreselassie of Ethiopia broke the world indoor 5,000 metres record at an international athletics meeting on Thursday with a time of 12 minutes 59.04 seconds.</p>
<p>He beat his own mark of 13:10.98 set in Sindelfingen, Germany, in January last year.</p>
